60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: The options are out. A is paid, B is shared racks, C is a lottery. Which one avoids the neighbour’s arrears trap?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: Option B feels kindest. No one is left out, and we stop the morning shoving match without charging anyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Shizue, but B ignores the money. The ledger says we need a levy for repairs. How do we fund that without charging?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,George,,"- **George**: @May, a flat maintenance levy covers the repairs. Option B avoids the billing burden that would crush the treasurer.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @George, but B means anyone can take the dry spots. The minutes show those were hoarded for years. How do we stop that?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Mio, the complaint log shows shared spaces fail without a clear owner. B risks repeating that exact silence.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Misaki, you’re right. But perhaps we rotate the dry spots weekly? That way, no one hoards them, and we keep the peace.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, rotating dry spots sounds lovely, but who physically moves the bikes? That’s extra work for someone, and we just agreed to avoid that.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,George,,"@May, you’re right. Moving bikes is exactly the kind of physical burden I wanted to avoid. We need a system that doesn’t create new chores.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@May, you’re right. Moving bikes is exactly the kind of physical burden I wanted to avoid. We need a system that doesn’t create new chores.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Mio, you’re right. Moving bikes is exactly the kind of physical burden I wanted to avoid. We need a system that doesn’t create new chores.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Misaki, I see your point. But if we don’t rotate, the same people will keep the dry spots, and the morning rush will continue.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Shizue, then let’s look at A. The riders said they’d pay to avoid equal counting. That solves the hoarding and funds the repairs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,George,,"@May, I hear the appeal, but the handover file shows billing is already three hours a month. Adding per-place tracking would break the system.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@George, the riders explicitly said they’d pay to avoid equal counting. If we don’t charge, we ignore their preference and keep the old bias.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Mio, their preference is clear, but the neighbour’s arrears show the social cost. I’m leaning toward C to keep the peace.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Misaki, a lottery feels so random. I worry it will leave people feeling unlucky and resentful, which is not peaceful.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,"@Shizue, resentment is better than the shoving match. And C ignores the riders who explicitly said they’d pay. I’m voting A.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,George,,"@May, I cannot support A. The paperwork burden is too heavy for one person. I am voting B, with a flat levy for maintenance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Mio,,"@May, I respect your vote, but the minutes prove the old bias. I’m voting C to break that cycle and start fresh.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
